        <fullName>Visit_information_FAQ_16jak000001lL0P</fullName>
        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Visit preparation and education from Knowledge: what to bring, carry, keep, or pack; things to take care of while visiting; what to know before or during a clinic or hospital appointment; first oncology visit preparation; documents, IDs, checklists; visiting hours, etiquette, privacy, billing literacy, parking, check-in, arrival logistics. Includes phrases like &quot;things to take care of while visiting for appointment&quot; or &quot;what should I prepare&quot;. Not for booking slots, finding doctors, or insurance summaries—those use other topics.</description>
        <developerName>Visit_information_FAQ_16jak000001lL0P</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Topic guard: If the user mentions visiting, appointment preparation, clinic, hospital, what to bring/carry/keep/take care of/pack, documents, ID, check-in, or logistics before arrival—this is Visit information (FAQ). Do not route to Off Topic or Scheduling.</description>
            <developerName>instruction_faq_not_off_topic</developerName>
